WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The military secretly released bacteria near San Francisco in 1950.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A release, exposure and a particular infection are different claims.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Nevin’s family alleged that the test caused his death; that link was not established.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The 1983 majority dismissed on government-immunity grounds. Consent remains a separate question.
